0,Mixtec culture - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mixtec_culture,"1 week ago - The chronology of the Mixtec culture is one of the longest in Mesoamerica, due to its continuity and antiquity. It began as a result of the cultural diversification of the Otomanguean language speaking people in the area of Oaxaca. The Mixtecs shared numerous cultural traits with their Zapotec ...","Mixtec, Southeastern Nochixtlán",Otomanguean
